<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lam Research.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lam Research.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist cut estimates for fiscal Q297 to $0.07/shr from $0.14, reduced estimates for fiscal Q397 to $0.07/shr from $0.15/shr,and cut estimates for fiscal Q497 $0.15/shr from $0.23/shr.</p>
<p>-- Expects to see improvements starting in June qtr of 1997.</p>
<p>-- Maintaining hold rating.</p>
</text>
